{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70522","main_id":70522,"main_title":"码头的饮品小店","main_description":"璃月港北码头的新店店主曲清似乎在寻求帮助…","chapter_title":"码头的饮品小店","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7052201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7052201,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":705220104,"next_line_ids":[705220106],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":1041696394,"text":"谢谢啦，我们不是客人。","raw_text":"谢谢啦，我们不是客人。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7052201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70522","main_id":70522,"main_title":"码头的饮品小店","main_description":"璃月港北码头的新店店主曲清似乎在寻求帮助…","chapter_title":"码头的饮品小店","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7052201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7052201,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":705220106,"next_line_ids":[705220107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":3048236010,"text":"对哦，我们是办事可靠的跑腿人！听说你在佳酿节上发布了委托，想请懂行的人帮你订购饮品，所以我们就找过来啦。","raw_text":"对哦，我们是办事可靠的跑腿人！听说你在佳酿节上发布了委托，想请懂行的人帮你订购饮品，所以我们就找过来啦。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7052201.json"}
