{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70522","main_id":70522,"main_title":"码头的饮品小店","main_description":"璃月港北码头的新店店主曲清似乎在寻求帮助…","chapter_title":"码头的饮品小店","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7052201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7052201,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":705220108,"next_line_ids":[705220109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30238,"speaker_text_hash":2279413392,"speaker":"曲清","speaker_raw":"曲清","text_hash":897081298,"text":"为了帮客人们下单…专门跑到璃月来了？你们真是热心肠！","raw_text":"为了帮客人们下单…专门跑到璃月来了？你们真是热心肠！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7052201.json"}
