{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70522","main_id":70522,"main_title":"码头的饮品小店","main_description":"璃月港北码头的新店店主曲清似乎在寻求帮助…","chapter_title":"码头的饮品小店","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7052201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7052201,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":705220110,"next_line_ids":[705220111],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30238,"speaker_text_hash":2279413392,"speaker":"曲清","speaker_raw":"曲清","text_hash":2952035130,"text":"我听去过蒙德的水手说，猫尾酒馆的特色饮品「薄荷莓果」既解渴又安神。","raw_text":"我听去过蒙德的水手说，<color=#00E1FFFF>猫尾酒馆</color>的特色饮品「薄荷莓果」既解渴又安神。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7052201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70522","main_id":70522,"main_title":"码头的饮品小店","main_description":"璃月港北码头的新店店主曲清似乎在寻求帮助…","chapter_title":"码头的饮品小店","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7052201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7052201,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":705220111,"next_line_ids":[705220112],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30238,"speaker_text_hash":2279413392,"speaker":"曲清","speaker_raw":"曲清","text_hash":3034311346,"text":"所以我想订购65箱「薄荷莓果」，和其他饮品交替着卖给水手们。如此一来，他们就能保持好心情和工作效率了。","raw_text":"所以我想订购<color=#00E1FFFF>65箱「薄荷莓果」</color>，和其他饮品交替着卖给水手们。如此一来，他们就能保持好心情和工作效率了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7052201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-70522","main_id":70522,"main_title":"码头的饮品小店","main_description":"璃月港北码头的新店店主曲清似乎在寻求帮助…","chapter_title":"码头的饮品小店","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7052201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7052201,"sequence":10,"variant":0,"line_id":705220112,"next_line_ids":[705220113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30238,"speaker_text_hash":2279413392,"speaker":"曲清","speaker_raw":"曲清","text_hash":3809010474,"text":"以前蒙德的商人也会根据我的需要准备指定的等价物。这次我按佳酿节的规矩，提前筹集了一些「佳酿晶冻」，都交给你们了！","raw_text":"以前蒙德的商人也会根据我的需要准备指定的等价物。这次我按佳酿节的规矩，提前筹集了一些「佳酿晶冻」，都交给你们了！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7052201.json"}
